WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.667 --> 00:00:20.855
Riley: Is everyone ready for the pet store party?

2
00:00:20.856 --> 00:00:23.784
Sarah: I have my Happy Birthday balloons.

3
00:00:23.785 --> 00:00:26.993
Skyler: Here are my two flowerpots.

4
00:00:26.994 --> 00:00:29.864
Ben: I brought my two turtle socks!

5
00:00:29.865 --> 00:00:34.833
Riley: I'll carry Goldie and Goofy in my bag.

6
00:00:34.834 --> 00:00:41.271
Riley: They will be surprised to see the pet store again!

7
00:00:41.272 --> 00:00:44.642
Skyler: But where's Theo?

8
00:00:44.643 --> 00:00:47.596
Theo: Here I am.

9
00:00:47.597 --> 00:00:51.128
I brought two frog cupcakes.

10
00:00:51.129 --> 00:00:54.822
Theo: And my big sister.

11
00:00:54.823 --> 00:00:57.420
Kelli: I'll walk to the pet shop with you.

12
00:00:57.421 --> 00:01:00.896
Mrs. Summers: Thank you, Kelli.

13
00:01:00.897 --> 00:01:08.900
Good luck, everybody.

14
00:01:08.901 --> 00:01:10.661
Kelli: Can you kids hurry?

15
00:01:10.662 --> 00:01:13.305
I'm supposed to meet Curtis at the pet shop.

16
00:01:13.306 --> 00:01:18.389
Theo: Ha-ha! Curtis is your boyfriend!

17
00:01:18.390 --> 00:01:22.183
Kelli: Be quiet, Theo.

18
00:01:22.184 --> 00:01:24.452
Riley: I'm so excited.

19
00:01:24.453 --> 00:01:27.787
We have ten great things!

20
00:01:27.788 --> 00:01:33.527
Skyler: And we each get to pick out a prize.

21
00:01:33.528 --> 00:01:37.507
Ben: Maybe I'll get Speedy some turtle food.

22
00:01:37.508 --> 00:01:41.805
Sarah: I hope they have kitten stickers.

23
00:01:41.806 --> 00:01:45.555
Riley: I'd like to get a bone for Snooks.

24
00:01:45.556 --> 00:01:53.977
Snooks: Ar-ooo!

25
00:01:53.978 --> 00:01:56.453
Riley: Snooks, hurry up!

26
00:01:56.454 --> 00:01:59.896
Snooks likes to stop and sniff.

27
00:01:59.897 --> 00:02:03.052
Skyler: These flowerpots are heavy.

28
00:02:03.053 --> 00:02:12.626
I think I'll sit down.

29
00:02:12.627 --> 00:02:16.410
Ben: Snooks is sniffing Skyler's flowers!

30
00:02:16.411 --> 00:02:20.206
Riley: Snooks, stop!

31
00:02:20.207 --> 00:02:25.579
Skyler: Oh no, Snooks ruined all my flowers!

32
00:02:25.580 --> 00:02:31.220
Riley: Oh, Snooks! Look what you've done!

33
00:02:31.221 --> 00:02:36.415
Snooks: Ar-ooo!

34
00:02:36.416 --> 00:02:40.192
Ben: Now we only have eight things for the party!

35
00:02:40.193 --> 00:02:47.205
Skyler: And it's the pet store's tenth birthday!
